{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701080/extras/2ea8e579d00b7448b6bc3bc96fc0f44a.webp?t=1604510180\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701080/extras/2ea8e579d00b7448b6bc3bc96fc0f44a.poster.avif?t=1604510180\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=410 /></picture></span><br><br>Inspired in the all-time karts games classics, Supersonic Tank Cats breezes into Steam to capture the style and manners of sagas such as Mario Kart and Sonic &amp; All Stars Racing. The game offers full Time Trials, Grand Prix and online/offline multiplayer Splitscreen GP and Battle Modes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Tech Tank-Kitty Roaster</h2>Choose between five adorable half-cat-half-combat fully armed vehicles to prevent your rivals from winning. Each character has a different playstyle and backstory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701080/extras/19310aaaebc57749357bfe193bc34695.avif?t=1604510180\" width=616 height=225 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wacky Cartoony Racetracks</h2>At this stage you can compete in 4 distinct zany tracks and become No.1 Champion! More racetracks will be included as the Early Access progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701080/extras/d624ce5219e5e5b4ddf8eebc2696a627.avif?t=1604510180\" width=616 height=140 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons \u00e0 gogo</h2>Each of these wheeled creatures is equipped with powerful arms. Use special power-ups to gain advantage from other racers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701080/extras/5253e9d38b3fb923780164038b3d6be2.webp?t=1604510180\" width=616 height=63 /></span>","achievements":{"highli